tégicas e construir uma visão compartilhada para o crescimento da Scania na América Latina até 2030.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-stats\">\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"3\">3</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">workshops</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"80\">80</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">executivos</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"5\">5</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">diretrizes estratégicas</span>\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"case-quote\">\n          <p>\"Conseguimos criar um alinhamento estratégico real entre lideranças de diferentes países. A abordagem de futures foi reveladora para toda a equipe.\"</p>\n          <cite>Martin Andersson — VP of Strategy LATAM, Scania</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"case-link\">Ver case completo <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n  <!-- ========== CASE 05 — GOOGLE ========== -->\n  <article class=\"case-item\" data-industry=\"tecnologia\" data-type=\"palestra\" data-territory=\"tecnologias\">\n    <div class=\"case-vis\">\n      <svg viewbox=\"0 0 600 600\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid slice\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <!-- Concentric rings — AI signal (light) -->\n        <g transform=\"translate(300,300)\">\n          <circle r=\"215\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.35\" opacity=\"0.1\"></circle>\n          <circle r=\"185\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.35\" opacity=\"0.12\"></circle>\n          <circle r=\"155\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.15\"></circle>\n          <circle r=\"125\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.45\" opacity=\"0.18\"></circle>\n          <circle r=\"96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.22\"></circle>\n          <circle 