e-link\">Ver case completo <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n  <!-- ========== CASE 06 — NESTLÉ ========== -->\n  <article class=\"case-item\" data-industry=\"consumo\" data-type=\"jornada\" data-territory=\"lideranca\">\n    <div class=\"case-vis\">\n      <svg viewbox=\"0 0 600 600\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid slice\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <!-- Overlapping rings — Culture (dark) -->\n        <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"230\" r=\"145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" opacity=\"0.18\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"230\" r=\"145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" opacity=\"0.18\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"365\" r=\"145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" opacity=\"0.18\"></circle>\n        <!-- Inner (tighter) rings -->\n        <circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"230\" r=\"90\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.25\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"230\" r=\"90\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.25\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"365\" r=\"90\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.05)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" opacity=\"0.35\"></circle>\n        <!-- Centre intersection -->\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"290\" r=\"42\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.10)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.45\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"290\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#E64E0E\" opacity=\"0.8\"></circle>\n        <!-- Country indicator dots -->\n        <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"160\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.38\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"155\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.38\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"465\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#E64E0E\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"305\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.28\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"472\" cy=\"298\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.28\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"448\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.25\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"450\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.25\"></circle>\n        <!-- Thin lines to center -->\n        <line x1=\"165\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.35\" opacity=\"0.14\"></line>\n        <line x1=\"435\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.35\" opacity=\"0.14\"></line>\n        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"465\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.28\"></line>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"case-cnt\">\n      <span class=\"case-ghost\">06</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-tags\">\n          <span class=\"tag tag-lid\">Liderança &amp; Cultura</span>\n          <span class=\"tag tag-sec\">Jornada de Transformação</span>\n          <span class=\"tag tag-sec\">Consumo</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"case-client\">NESTLÉ</div>\n        <h2 class=\"case-title\">Reconstruindo a cultura de times híbridos em 14 países simultaneamente</h2>\n        <p class=\"case-desc\">Jornada de transformação cultural desenhada para times que trabalham de forma distribuída, com foco em criar pertencimento, alinhamento de propósito e rituais de colaboração que funcionam além das fronteiras geográficas.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-stats\">\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"14\">14</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">países</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"1200\">1.200</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">pessoas envolvidas</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"18\">18</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">meses de jornada</span>\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"case-quote\">\n          <p>\"Conseguimos criar uma cultura comum em times que nunca se encontram pessoalmente. Isso era algo que achávamos impossível antes desse programa.\"</p>\n          <cite>Isabela Santos — VP People &amp; Culture LATAM, Nestlé</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"case-link\">Ver case completo <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n  <!-- ========== CASE 07 — IBM ========== -->\n  <article class=\"case-item\" data-industry=\"tecnologia\" data-type=\"cocriacoes\" data-territory=\"inovacao\">\n    <div class=\"case-vis\">\n      <svg viewbox=\"0 0 600 600\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid slice\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <!-- Mondrian-style modular grid — Co-creation (light) -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.14\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"260\" y=\"60\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" fill=\"rgba(12,10,9,0.04)\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.18\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"390\" y=\"60\" width=\"150\" height=\"280\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.14\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"260\" width=\"130\" height=\"280\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.05)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.22\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"190\" y=\"190\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"rgba(12,10,9,0.03)\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.16\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"260\" y=\"190\" width=\"130\" height=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(12,10,9,0.06)\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.18\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"390\" y=\"340\" width=\"150\" height=\"120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.14\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"540\" width=\"330\" height=\"0\" fill=\"none\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"390\" y=\"460\" width=\"75\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.08)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" opacity=\"0.28\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"465\" y=\"460\" width=\"75\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.12\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"465\" y=\"500\" width=\"75\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(12,10,9,0.05)\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.14\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"190\" y=\"390\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" fill=\"rgba(12,10,9,0.03)\" stroke=\"#0C0A09\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.12\"></rect>\n        <!-- Accent fills -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0C0A09\" opacity=\"0.06\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"195\" y=\"65\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" fill=\"#E64E0E\" opacity=\"0.07\"></rect>\n        <rect x=\"190\" y=\"260\" width=\"70\" height=\"130\" fill=\"#0C0A09\" opacity=\"0.04\"></rect>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"case-cnt\">\n      <span class=\"case-ghost\">07</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-tags\">\n          <span class=\"tag tag-inn\">Inovação &amp; Criatividade</span>\n          <span class=\"tag tag-sec\">Cocriação</span>\n          <span class=\"tag tag-sec\">Tecnologia</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"case-client\">IBM</div>\n        <h2 class=\"case-title\">Cocriando o futuro do trabalho com líderes de 8 setores da economia brasileira</h2>\n        <p class=\"case-desc\">Laboratório de cocriação reunindo líderes de Finanças, Saúde, Varejo, Educação, Energia, Logística, Manufatura e Governo para desenvolver frameworks sobre o futuro do trabalho com IA e automação em escala nacional.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-stats\">\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"8\">8</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">setores envolvidos</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"45\">45</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">líderes</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"3\">3</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">frameworks gerados</span>\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"case-quote\">\n          <p>\"A cocriação entre setores diferentes gerou insights que nenhum de nós teria individualmente. Foi um dos processos mais ricos que já vivenciei na carreira.\"</p>\n          <cite>Roberto Faria — Director of Innovation, IBM Brasil</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"case-link\">Ver case completo <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n  <!-- ========== CASE 08 — PEPSICO ========== -->\n  <article class=\"case-item\" data-industry=\"consumo\" data-type=\"assessment\" data-territory=\"futuro\">\n    <div class=\"case-vis\">\n      <svg viewbox=\"0 0 600 600\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid slice\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <!-- Hexagonal skills map (dark) -->\n        <!-- Row 1 -->\n        <polygon points=\"300,72 327,87 327,117 300,132 273,117 273,87\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.18)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" opacity=\"0.75\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Row 2 -->\n        <polygon points=\"240,132 267,147 267,177 240,192 213,177 213,147\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.55\" opacity=\"0.48\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"360,132 387,147 387,177 360,192 333,177 333,147\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.55\" opacity=\"0.48\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Row 3 -->\n        <polygon points=\"180,192 207,207 207,237 180,252 153,237 153,207\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.38\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"300,192 327,207 327,237 300,252 273,237 273,207\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.10)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.7\" opacity=\"0.55\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"420,192 447,207 447,237 420,252 393,237 393,207\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.38\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Row 4 -->\n        <polygon points=\"120,252 147,267 147,297 120,312 93,297 93,267\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.28\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"240,252 267,267 267,297 240,312 213,297 213,267\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.55\" opacity=\"0.44\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"360,252 387,267 387,297 360,312 333,297 333,267\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.55\" opacity=\"0.44\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"480,252 507,267 507,297 480,312 453,297 453,267\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.28\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Row 5 -->\n        <polygon points=\"180,312 207,327 207,357 180,372 153,357 153,327\" fill=\"rgba(230,78,14,0.08)\" stroke=\"#E64E0E\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" opacity=\"0.38\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"300,312 327,327 327,357 300,372 273,357 273,327\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.32\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"420,312 447,327 447,357 420,372 393,357 393,327\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.55\" opacity=\"0.38\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Row 6 -->\n        <polygon points=\"240,372 267,387 267,417 240,432 213,417 213,387\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.24\"></polygon>\n        <polygon points=\"360,372 387,387 387,417 360,432 333,417 333,387\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" opacity=\"0.24\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Row 7 -->\n        <polygon points=\"300,432 327,447 327,477 300,492 273,477 273,447\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.015)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"0.3\" opacity=\"0.18\"></polygon>\n        <!-- Highlight dots -->\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"102\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#E64E0E\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"222\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#E64E0E\" opacity=\"0.7\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"342\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#E64E0E\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"case-cnt\">\n      <span class=\"case-ghost\">08</span>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-tags\">\n          <span class=\"tag tag-fut\">Visão de Futuro &amp; Estratégia</span>\n          <span class=\"tag tag-sec\">Assessment de Skills</span>\n          <span class=\"tag tag-sec\">Consumo</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"case-client\">PEPSICO</div>\n        <h2 class=\"case-title\">Mapeando competências críticas para construir a estratégia de talentos 2025–2030</h2>\n        <p class=\"case-desc\">Processo estruturado de assessment das competências críticas para o futuro — mapeando onde a organização está hoje e onde precisa chegar em 5 anos — para embasar o roadmap de desenvolvimento de talentos da PepsiCo LATAM.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"case-stats\">\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"800\">800</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">profissionais mapeados</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"12\">12</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">competências críticas</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"c-stat\">\n<span class=\"c-num\" data-n=\"5\">5</span><span class=\"c-lbl\">anos de roadmap</span>\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"case-quote\">\n          <p>\"O assessment foi além do diagnóstico. Chegamos com um plano claro, priorizado e com o buy-in das lideranças para os próximos cinco anos de desenvolvimento.\"</p>\n          <cite>Fernanda Costa — CHRO LATAM, PepsiCo</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"case-link\">Ver case completo <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- ============ CTA ============ -->\n<section class=\"cta-block\">\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"cta-eyebrow\">Próximo passo</p>\n    <h2 class=\"cta-title\">PRONTO PARA<br>SER O PRÓXIMO<br><span class=\"t-orange\">CASE?</span>\n</h2>\n    <p class=\"cta-p\">Conte o desafio do seu time. A gente ouve, entende e constrói uma jornada que faz sentido para o seu momento — e para os próximos cinco anos.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cta-right\">\n    <div class=\"cta-person\">\n      <div class=\"cta-avatar\">VI</div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"cta-pname\">Vivi Ishikawa</p>\n        <p class=\"cta-prole\">Business Development — Hyper Island Brasil</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"mailto:learning.latam@hyperisland.com\" class=\"btn-primary\">Agendar uma conversa →</a>\n    <a href=\"https://wa.me/5511999999999\" class=\"btn-sec\">Enviar mensagem</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <span class=\"footer-logo\">HYPER ISLAND</span>\n  <span class=\"footer-copy\">© 1996–2026 Hyper Island · learning.latam@hyperisland.com</span>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n/* =========================================\n   FILTER SYSTEM\n   ========================================= */\nconst state = { industry: null, type: null, territory: null };\n\nconst labels = {\n  industry:  { financeiro:'Financeiro', tecnologia:'Tecnologia', consumo:'Consumo & Varejo', industrial:'Industrial' },\n  type:      { jornada:'Jornada de Transformação', workshop:'Workshop', sprint:'Sprint de Inovação',\n               palestra:'Palestra', curso:'Curso In-Company', cocriacoes:'Cocriação', assessment:'Assessment de Skills' },\n  territory: { futuro:'Visão de Futuro & Estratégia', inovacao:'Inovação & Criatividade',\n               tecnologias:'Tecnologias Emergentes', lideranca:'Liderança & Cultura' }\n};\n\nfunction toggleDrop(cat) {\n  const drop = document.getElementById('drop-' + cat);\n  const trig = document.getElementById('trig-' + cat);\n  const isOpen = drop.classList.contains('is-open');\n  // Close all\n  document.querySelectorAll('.f-dropdown').forEach(d => d.classList.remove('is-open'));\n  document.querySelectorAll('.f-trigger').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('is-open'));\n  if (!isOpen) {\n    drop.classList.add('is-open');\n    trig.classList.add('is-open');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction selectF(el) {\n  const cat = el.dataset.cat;\n  const val = el.dataset.val;\n  // Toggle (radio per category)\n  if (state[cat] === val) {\n    state[cat] = null;\n    el.classList.remove('is-sel');\n    el.querySelector('.f-chk').textContent = '';\n  } else {\n    // Clear previous selection in this category\n    document.querySelectorAll('#drop-' + cat + ' .f-opt').forEach(o => {\n      o.classList.remove('is-sel');\n      o.querySelector('.f-chk').textContent = '';\n    });\n    state[cat] = val;\n    el.classList.add('is-sel');\n    el.querySelector('.f-chk').textContent = '✓';\n  }\n  applyFilters();\n  renderChips();\n  updateTriggers();\n  // Close dropdown\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    document.getElementById('drop-' + cat).classList.remove('is-open');\n    document.getElementById('trig-' + cat).classList.remove('is-open');\n  }, 160);\n}\n\nfunction applyFilters() {\n  const items = document.querySelectorAll('.case-item');\n  let count = 0;\n  items.forEach(item => {\n    const ok =\n      (!state.industry  || item.dataset.industry  === state.industry)  &&\n      (!state.type      || item.dataset.type      === state.type)      &&\n      (!state.territory || item.dataset.territory === state.territory);\n    if (ok) {\n      item.classList.remove('is-hidden');\n      // Ensure visible animation\n      if (!item.classList.contains('is-vis')) item.classList.add('is-vis');\n      count++;\n    } else {\n      item.classList.add('is-hidden');\n    }\n  });\n  document.getElementById('fCount').textContent = count + (count === 1 ? ' case' : ' cases');\n  document.getElementById('emptyState').classList.toggle('is-vis', count === 0);\n}\n\nfunction renderChips() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('fChips');\n  container.innerHTML = '';\n  let any = false;\n  Object.keys(state).forEach(cat => {\n    const val = state[cat];\n    if (!val) return;\n    any = true;\n    const chip = document.createElement('div');\n    chip.className = 'f-chip';\n    chip.innerHTML = (labels[cat][val] || val) + ' <span class=\"f-chip-x\" data-cat=\"' + cat + '\">×</span>';\n    chip.querySelector('.f-chip-x').addEventListener('click', e => {\n      removeFilter(e.target.dataset.cat);\n    });\n    container.appendChild(chip);\n  });\n  document.getElementById('clearBtn').classList.toggle('is-vis', any);\n}\n\nfunction updateTriggers() {\n  ['industry','type','territory'].forEach(cat => {\n    const trig = document.getElementById('trig-' + cat);\n    const badge = trig.querySelector('.f-badge');\n    if (state[cat]) {\n      if (!badge) {\n        const b = document.createElement('span');\n        b.className = 'f-badge'; b.textContent = '1';\n        trig.appendChild(b);\n      }\n      trig.classList.add('is-active');\n    } else {\n      if (badge) badge.remove();\n      trig.classList.remove('is-active');\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nfunction removeFilter(cat) {\n  state[cat] = null;\n  document.querySelectorAll('#drop-' + cat + ' .f-opt').forEach(o => {\n    o.classList.remove('is-sel');\n    o.querySelector('.f-chk').textContent = '';\n  });\n  applyFilters();\n  renderChips();\n  updateTriggers();\n}\n\nfunction clearAll() {\n  Object.keys(state).forEach(k => {\n    state[k] = null;\n    document.querySelectorAll('#drop-' + k + ' .f-opt').forEach(o => {\n      o.classList.remove('is-sel');\n      o.querySelector('.f-chk').textContent = '';\n    });\n  });\n  applyFilters();\n  renderChips();\n  updateTriggers();\n}\n\n// Close dropdowns on outside click\ndocument.addEventListener('click', e => {\n  if (!e.target.closest('.f-group')) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.f-dropdown').forEach(d => d.classList.remove('is-open'));\n    document.querySelectorAll('.f-trigger').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('is-open'));\n  }\n});\n\n/* =========================================\n   SCROLL REVEAL\n   ========================================= */\nconst revealObs = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n  entries.forEach(e => {\n    if (e.isIntersecting) {\n      e.target.classList.add('is-vis');\n      revealObs.unobserve(e.target);\n    }\n  });\n}, { threshold: 0.08, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.case-item').forEach((item, i) => {\n  item.style.transitionDelay = (i < 2 ? i * 0.06 : 0) + 's';\n  revealObs.observe(item);\n});\n\n/* =========================================\n   STAT COUNTER ANIMATION\n   ========================================= */\nfunction animCount(el) {\n  const orig = el.textContent;\n  const n = parseInt(el.dataset.n);\n  if (isNaN(n)) return;\n  const suffix = orig.replace(/[\\d.,]/g, '');\n  const dur = 1100;\n  const t0 = performance.now();\n  function tick(now) {\n    const p = Math.min((now - t0) / dur, 1);\n    const ease = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3);\n    const cur = Math.round(n * ease);\n    el.textContent = cur.toLocaleString('pt-BR') + suffix;\n    if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n}\n\nconst statObs = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n  entries.forEach(e => {\n    if (e.isIntersecting) {\n      e.target.querySelectorAll('.c-num').forEach(animCount);\n      statObs.unobserve(e.target);\n    }\n  });\n}, { threshold: 0.25 });\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.case-item').forEach(item => statObs.observe(item));\n</script>",
